n the shard catalog cache for a database absent from the global catalog\"","             kMalformedTimeseriesBucketsCollection: \"Found malformed timeseries collection\"","+            kUnparsableShardCatalogEntry: \"Found an unparsable entry in the shard catalog\"","             kInconsistentShardCatalogCollectionMetadata: \"Found inconsistencies between collection metadata in the global catalog and the shard catalog\"","             kIncompatibleUniqueIndexOnShardedCollection: \"Found incompatible index options with uniqueness in a sharded collection\"","             kLegacyShardCacheCollectionsPresent: \"Found legacy non-authoritative shard catalog cache collections on a shard that is fully upgraded\"","@@ -585,6 +595,81 @@ structs:","                 type: object","                 description: \"Collection options not matching the expeced format.\""," ","+    DatabaseMetadataForNonExistingDatabaseInShardCatalogDetails:","+        description: \"Details about durable database metadata for a database absent from the global catalog.\"","+        strict: false","+        fields:","+            dbName:","+                type: database_name","+                description: \"The database name.\"","+            shardId:","+                type: shard_id","+                description: \"The shard where the metadata was found.\"","+            primary:","+                type: shard_id","+                description: \"The primary shard recorded in the metadata.\"","+            version:","+                type: database_version","+                description: \"The database version recorded in the metadata.\"","+","+    DatabaseMetadataForNonExistingDatabaseInShardCatalogCacheDetails:","+        description: \"Details about cached database metadata for a database absent from the global catalog.\"","+        strict: false","+        fields:","+            dbName:","+                type: database_name","+                description: \"The database name.\"","+          